Changes made to the original content (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):

  - Text was extracted from the HTML pages and reformatted into JSON/JS data.
  - Long descriptions and tables were split, normalized and, where noted in the
    build scripts, truncated; markup, navigation and scripts were removed.
  - Search indexes, relationship data and a user interface were added.
  - The "constraints and limitations" shown for each API are sentences
    extracted automatically (by pattern matching) from the original descriptions,
    plus differences computed between the 4.22, 4.21 and 4.20 editions. They are
    not authoritative; consult the original documentation.
  - The "general relationships" shown in the topology view are NOT part of the
    original documentation. They were compiled separately from general
    knowledge of Kubernetes/OpenShift and are marked as such in the interface.
  - Usage examples (YAML, oc, REST) are templates generated from API names,
    group/versions and required fields; they are not taken from the original.

